{%- comment -%}
  Collection FAQ from the custom.faq metafield (SEO brief C2) — the content
  team fills FAQs per collection in admin without a code change.

  Metafield: namespace custom, key faq, type JSON. Value is a list of objects:
    [
      { "q": "Is a 7 ratti pukhraj enough?", "a": "<p>Most astrologers…</p>" },
      { "question": "…", "answer": "…" }
    ]
  Both q/a and question/answer keys are accepted; answers may contain HTML.
  When the metafield is empty the caller falls back to snippets/cht-faq.liquid.

  Params: collection, part — 'html' (default, same markup as cht-faq so the
  PLP accordion JS formats it) or 'json' (FAQPage mainEntity items).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign cf_items = collection.metafields.custom.faq.value -%}
{%- if cf_items.size > 0 -%}
  {%- if part == 'json' -%}
    {%- for it in cf_items -%}
      {%- assign cf_q = it.q | default: it.question | strip_html | strip -%}
      {%- assign cf_a = it.a | default: it.answer | replace: '</li>', '</li> ' | replace: '</p>', '</p> ' | strip_html | strip | replace: '  ', ' ' -%}
      {%- if cf_q == blank or cf_a == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ cf_q | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ cf_a | json }} } }{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="gem-tab cht-faq cht-faq--metafield">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions about {{ collection.title }}</h2>
      {%- for it in cf_items -%}
        {%- assign cf_q = it.q | default: it.question | strip -%}
        {%- assign cf_a = it.a | default: it.answer | strip -%}
        {%- if cf_q == blank or cf_a == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        <div class="cht-faq__item"><h3 class="cht-faq__q">{{ cf_q }}</h3> <div class="cht-faq__a">{% if cf_a contains '<p' or cf_a contains '<ul' %}{{ cf_a }}{% else %}<p>{{ cf_a }}</p>{% endif %}</div></div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
